# Canonical host: www -> apex.
# NOT doable here — Cloudflare Pages _redirects matches paths only on a custom
# domain, so a hostname-scoped source is silently ignored (verified: www still
# returns 200). Configure a Redirect Rule in the Cloudflare dashboard instead:
#   Rules > Redirect Rules > hostname eq "www.noisedecibelmeter.com"
#   -> 301 to https://noisedecibelmeter.com/${http.request.uri.path}
# Until then the cross-host canonical on every www page points at the apex.

